",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"No. Purchasing depends on stock, approvals, payment providers and platform restrictions. CAPTCHA or access challenges are handed to an authorised person."}]]}],["$","details","How long does a project take?",{"open":false,"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["How long does a project take?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We confirm a schedule after mapping the workflow, integrations and approval points. A focused prototype comes first, followed by the agreed build and testing scope."}]]}]]}]]}]
